Script purpose:
- run a focused local benchmark for `recommend_full_build` only
- read the model matrix from the backend `.env`
- execute 5 curated cases against every configured model
- write result artifacts and keep a user-editable token-price template on disk

Main flow:
- parse optional CLI overrides for data_version, output directory, price-file path, provider filters, model filters, and DEBUG_LLM behavior
- bootstrap the normal backend app wiring through the shared local eval app factory
- resolve the active data version unless the user overrides it
- load model refs from `.env` via the dedicated recommend_full_build benchmark helper
- optionally filter the loaded model refs down to one or more providers and/or specific model identifiers, including `.env`-style `provider:model`
- run the benchmark with the interactive progress bar enabled
- print one-line failure reasons to the terminal during the run
- run the benchmark and print the saved artifact paths
